      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It looks like this issue has been fixed. I haven't encountered any issues with VRChat constantly crashing upon joining certain worlds, being sent to my homeworld for trying to join certain worlds, and avatars having weird glitchy appearances ever since, but one of the developers hasn't informed me that this issue has been fixed, or marked this post as 'Solved' yet.\n\nStill, I have a weird feeling this same issue will come back sometime again. I don't know if it's still time to replace my CPU because I'm not buying things only to find out that it causes more issues than it did fixing the issue I'm having right now. When I got a new graphics card for my birthday, all it ever did was prevent me from using my Valve Index, so I can't bear to trust buying a new CPU as of right now.\n\nBut anyway, please let me know your thoughts on this. I have nothing much to say, but I just hope this issue I've had for over 10 months doesn't come back to haunt me again.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
